          "title": "Chronological timeline",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "2a.1",
              "text": "On 2026-03-14 at 04:55, the Ashfell slide damaged the lower road; by 07:24, a warning was issued for Withel terraces and Cranmoor; by 07:40, about 60 households were evacuated from Withel terraces.",
